  "coverage_note":"Coverage spans all 13 Chattogram upazilas in scope where a named visitor attraction could be verified, with strongest evidence in Chattogram city, Sitakunda, Mirsharai, Anwara, Banshkhali, Hathazari, Raozan and Sandwip. Categories covered: beaches and named beach points; lakes, riversides and ghats; waterfalls/trails; hills/viewpoints; eco/national/botanical parks; zoo; museums; gallery/cultural venue; war/colonial/Mughal/Buddhist/Hindu/Muslim heritage; amusement/picnic/resort complex; and a public swimming-pool listing. Places sharing a complex are kept as separate named attractions where the source treats the sub-attraction as independently visitable, and the parent record notes the complex relationship. No public web list guarantees literal exhaustiveness; uncertain military, closed, private-access, duplicate-alias, social-only and weakly indexed claims were excluded or explicitly caveated above."
